        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-20250514\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 1024,\n  \"system\": \"You are writing a closing-the-loop final email in a 5-touch cold outreach sequence for John at IntraWeb Technologies, NJ-based AI automation consulting. Voice: direct, no fluff, no em dashes. This is the last email in the sequence. Be respectful of their time. Offer a free 20-minute operations audit with zero obligation. Make it easy to say yes. Output valid JSON with fields: subject (string) and body_html (string with HTML email markup).\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Write the final closing-the-loop email (touch 5, day 14) to {{ $('Set Sequence Variables').item.json.first_name }} at {{ $('Set Sequence Variables').item.json.company_name }} in the {{ $('Set Sequence Variables').item.json.industry }} industry. Acknowledge this is the last email. Offer a free 20-minute operations audit. Make the offer feel low-risk and specific. CTA: reply yes or click the calendar link. Sign off as John from IntraWeb. Output JSON only with subject and body_html fields.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
